"\n"
"#. Install\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Go to a posted vendor bill with landed cost lines and click \"Create Landed Costs\".\n"
"\n"
